      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this, it's a good start. It's professional, but I'm a little worried it's a bit too \"dry.\" \n\nI just ran it through our sentiment tool and the positivity score came back at about 0.55. For a crisis like this, our management usually likes to see something a bit more uplifting and warm so the brand doesn't feel \"heavy\" or depressing to read. \n\nCan you try another version? Try to make it feel a bit more bright and positive while still acknowledging the mistake. Just please, like I said before, don't go overboard with the happy language—we don't want it to look like we're laughing at their bad experience. Just make it feel more \"positive\" than the last one.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
